OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start, with overnight
OL,6,Frain continuing, before gradually
OL,7,Fclearing east through the day. Turning
OL,8,Fbrighter but also fresher from the
OL,9,Fwest, with all parts dry by the late
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSkies will clear over night
OL,13,Fwith some cloud lingering in the east
OL,14,Fof the region until the morning.
OL,15,FTemperatures will fall making it feel
OL,16,Fcooler than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
